# AZERO Design System

Refer to `/docs/design-system.md` for the complete design system documentation.

## Critical Rules

### Typography

**Text size = 16px minimum for standard content**

- `text-base` (16px) is the **default** for all standard text (paragraphs, descriptions, content)
- `text-sm` (12px) only for secondary information (metadata, sub-labels)
- `text-xs` (10px) only for labels, timestamps, minimal metadata
- Never use arbitrary sizes like `text-[13px]` — always use the defined scale

**Font families:**
- `font-exo` (default) for UI text
- `font-rajdhani` for titles, labels in caps, gaming elements

### Colors

Always use semantic color classes from the design system:

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
<p className="text-text">Main text</p>
<span className="text-text-dim">Secondary</span>

// ❌ BAD
<p className="text-gray-200">Main text</p>
<span style={{ color: '#888' }}>Secondary</span>
```

### Spacing

Use multiples of 4px via Tailwind utilities (`gap-1`, `gap-2`, `p-4`, etc.).

Never use arbitrary values unless absolutely necessary.

### Component Creation

When creating a new component:
1. Check existing components in `/components` for similar patterns
2. Use the defined typography scale (never `text-[13px]`, always `text-sm` or `text-base`)
3. Respect elevation hierarchy: `bg` < `surface` < `surface2` < `surface3`
4. Add `transition-all duration-150` for interactive elements
5. Use semantic color classes (`text-text`, `bg-surface`, `border-border`)

### Example: Correct Component

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
function InfoCard({ title, content }) {
  return (
    <div className="bg-surface border border-border rounded-lg p-6">
      <h3 className="text-lg font-rajdhani font-bold text-gold-light mb-2">
        {title}
      </h3>
      <p className="text-base text-text">
        {content}
      </p>
    </div>
  );
}

// ❌ BAD
function InfoCard({ title, content }) {
  return (
    <div style={{ background: '#13131a', border: '1px solid #2a2a3a', padding: 20 }}>
      <h3 style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 700 }}>{title}</h3>
      <p style={{ fontSize: 13 }}>{content}</p>
    </div>
  );
}
```

## Quick Reference

| Element | Class |
|---------|-------|
| Main text | `text-base text-text` (16px) |
| Secondary text | `text-sm text-text-dim` (12px) |
| Labels | `text-xs text-text-muted uppercase tracking-wider` (10px) |
| Title | `text-lg font-rajdhani font-bold` (20px) |
| Card | `bg-surface border border-border rounded-lg p-6` |
| Button | `bg-gold text-[#0c0c10] px-4 py-3 rounded font-bold` |
| Input | `bg-surface2 border border-border2 px-3 py-2.5 text-base focus:border-gold` |
